&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;text-indent:-40.5pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt; (注)　１　「完全議決権株式(その他)」欄の普通株式には、役員報酬ＢＩＰ(Board Incentive Plan)信託が所有する当社株式&lt;span&gt;2,343,400&lt;/span&gt;株(議決権の数23,434個)および証券保管振替機構名義の株式&lt;span&gt;7,500&lt;/span&gt;株(議決権の数75個)が含まれています。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;２　「単元未満株式」欄の普通株式には、当社所有の自己株式57株およびＢＩＰ信託が所有する当社株式&lt;span&gt;67&lt;/span&gt;株が含まれています。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:43.3pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-35.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:IssuedSharesVotingRightsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_SharesWithNoVotingRightsMember" xsi:nil="true"/>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_SharesWithRestrictedVotingRightsTreasurySharesEtcMember" xsi:nil="true"/>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_SharesWithRestrictedVotingRightsOtherMember" xsi:nil="true"/>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesTreasurySharesSharesWithFullVotingRightsTreasurySharesEtcMember">単元株式数100株</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesReciprocalHoldingSharesWithFullVotingRightsTreasurySharesEtcMember">同上</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesSharesWithFullVotingRightsOtherMember">同上</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesSharesLessThanOneUnitMember" xsi:nil="true"/>
  <jpcrp_cor:TreasurySharesEtcTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
