  <jpcrp030000-asr_E02166-000:NotesRegardingAdjustmentForTransferPricingTaxationTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27.4pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-27.4pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;※３　&lt;/span&gt;当事業年度の移転価格税制調整金は、移転価格税制に伴い当社が北米地域子会社に支払う見込みの調整額を&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27.4pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-27.4pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;      特別損失に計上しています。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E02166-000:NotesRegardingAdjustmentForTransferPricingTaxationTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingIssuedSharesAndTreasurySharesTextBlock contextRef="Prior1YearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;"&gt;自己株式数は、以下のとおりです。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30.1pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:438.1pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
